{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"五中全會前夕　北京副市長夏林茂涉嚴重違紀違法受查\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/BJ-MAYOR-261022-17.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】北京市副市長夏林茂涉嚴重違紀違法受查。</p><p>新華社報道，北京市委常委、副市長夏林茂涉嚴重違紀違法，正接受中央紀委國家監委紀律審查與監察調查。</p><p>56歲的夏林茂長期在北京規劃建設系統任職，三年前升任北京市副市長，並身兼中共中央候補委員。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:51:05.228991+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T09:17:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T22:38:40.398699+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T12:46:47.228093+00:00","content_hash":"b59e9cedbcddcdaa8ca9fb106e57b19875836b324e625c94a99b90f561d72ecf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}